      "category": "Text",
      "text": "On October 18, 1952, the National Safety Council will sponsor what promises to be one of the greatest parades in the history of our City -- the New York Green Cross Safety Parade -- which will proceed along Fifth Avenue from 95th Street to 62nd Street. Because of the importance of this event I am asking all City departments and agencies to cooperate with the New York Green Cross in making it a success. You will be hearing from parade director Demetrios Sazani regarding his plans for organization, and I ask that you give him your assistance.",
